sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant L as ToolLoop
  participant M as Model
  participant E as Executor
  participant W as get_weather

  U->>L: Weather in Berlin?
  L->>M: messages + tool schemas
  M-->>L: tool get_weather city=Berlin
  L->>E: validate + execute
  E->>W: get_weather
  W-->>E: temp/condition
  E-->>L: observation
  L->>M: untrusted evidence
  M-->>L: final answer
  L-->>U: "12 C cloudy (source tool)"
